chen und unterstützt den Hormonhaushalt.*</span></p><p><br><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Vitamin A</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Trägt zur Hautreinheit und allgemeinen Gesundheit bei.*</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Hilft bei: Sorgt für eine klarere Haut und unterstützt eine gesunde Hormonfunktion.*</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a092e4be-b9b2-417b-ad5b-83834ce3f54d" class="r-40ju2a" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="464dfe97-d0c3-475b-9df9-c79a10951a0c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1qir2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-x65z8u"><div data-rid="33d7b717-5755-4549-9811-8f58b4411b1f" class="r-96d37b alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-fontsize:20px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-fontfamily:Lora;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-lineheight:21px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-letterspacing:0px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-texttransform:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-